  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.05 “Advanced life support (ALS)” means medical procedures and the scope of practice rendered by advanced emergency medical care providers in accordance with RSA 153-A:12.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
